<td><a href="img/takaratomy044.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/takaratomy044_small.jpg" width="378" alt="画像" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/tta/deep_sea_creatures/img/takaratomy044.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
